@bank all
// MA6 (2026-10-27, Pillar 5 Step 6, S6-6, stand-in words until the head writer's): M24 Leading a team (section 28d).
// Night 3 (Day 24, from 21:00): a coil swap while the drive runs slow. You pick your team in the Works app's Team tab,
// book the slot with the Watch on the bridge, give each a spot, then call each step at the drive panel. Night 3 has one
// engine tech aboard (Davi Keane, he/him); the night Watch ratings help too ("after my round"). Said by nobody unless noted.

// the beats: the notice as your night starts, a crew member in person, the Mail (the record), the ring lines, the hourly notice
== m24.notice
- Tonight you lead the coil swap. Pick your team: Works, the Team tab.
== m24.say
// one of the night crew, near you before you've picked
- Calder says the coil swap's yours tonight. Pick your team, boss.
== m24.mail
- Tonight: the coil swap | You lead it. Pick your team, book the Watch, a spot each.
== m24.ptr.pick
- Pick your team
== m24.ptr.book
- Book the slot with the Watch
== m24.ptr.spots
- A spot for each, then the coil swap at {time}
== m24.busy
- The coil swap waits for you: {text}. Turn in or drop this job first.

// the answers when you pick someone (said by them)
== m24.pick.yes
- Yes. Where do you want me?
== m24.pick.friend
- For you? Yes. Now.
== m24.pick.later
- After my round. Twenty minutes.

// the Watch (the bridge's night watch officer, Anja Kowalczyk, she/her) books the slot
== m24.watch
- The Watch gives you {from} to {to}. The drive goes to slow on your call.

// your calls (the toast as each comes up) and the crew's replies as their step starts
== team.turn.cslow
- Your call: drive to slow. Next step, at the drive panel.
== team.turn.cunbolt
- Your call: unbolt it.
== team.turn.clift
- Your call: lift it out.
== team.turn.cseat
- Your call: seat the new coil.
== team.turn.ctest
- Your call: test it.
== team.turn.cup
- Your call: bring the drive back up.
== m24.next
// the button on your call's card
- Next step
== m24.reply.isolate
- Isolating. Coupling's cold.
== m24.reply.unbolt
- Bolts coming out. Mind your toes.
== m24.reply.lift
- Lifting. Easy, easy.
== m24.reply.seat
- Seating the new one. Gently.
== m24.reply.test
- Testing. Readings coming up.

// the end (said by the team's first), the Mail (the record)
== m24.done.early
- Done early. That was a good team.
== m24.done.on
- Done, on the hour. Clean work.
== m24.done.slow
- Done. Slow, but done. The coil doesn't mind.
== m24.mail.done
- The coil swap | Done in {n} minutes with {a} and {b}. Logged for Calder.

// the Works app's Team tab
== m24.tab
- Team
== m24.tab.none
- Team jobs you lead show here. Nothing tonight.
== m24.tab.done
- The coil swap: done in {n} minutes.
== m24.tab.head
- Tonight's coil swap: the drive runs slow for an hour while your team changes a coil.
== m24.step.pick
- 1. Pick your team
== m24.said.yes
- yes
== m24.said.later
- after their round
== m24.step.book
- 2. Book the slot with the Watch (on the bridge, Deck 1)
== m24.booked
- Booked: {from} to {to}.
== m24.book
- Book the slot
== m24.book.go
- Book the slot (go to the bridge)
== m24.book.no
- Pick your team first.
== m24.book.where
- The Watch books it: go up to the bridge, Deck 1.
== m24.step.spots
- 3. A spot for each
== m24.spot.1
- The coupling
== m24.spot.2
- The lifting frame
== m24.step.run
- 4. At the drive panel, call each step: Next step.
== m24.card
- The coil swap, {time}, Deck 6: your team
== m24.row.plan
- Plan the coil swap: your team, the Watch
== m24.row.swap
- The coil swap, your team
